Package: openmediavault-lightroomsync
Architecture: all
Depends: openmediavault (>= 7.0), python3 (>= 3.9), python3-pil, ${misc:Depends}
Description: openmediavault Adobe Lightroom sync plugin
 Downloads the photos of an Adobe Lightroom (cloud) library, or selected
 albums, to a shared folder on a schedule. Folder structure, file names,
 resolution, downscaling, metadata handling and the treatment of photos
 removed in Lightroom are configurable.
